<p>Here is each change and what happened next, with how sure we are. High confidence for the indexing fix and for the effect of social video. Medium for the German site. Low for longer texts, because other teams changed things the same day. The consolidation now has seven days of evidence: number one in the US and the UK on 21 November, in Germany on 22 and 23 November, and in the UK again on 23 November. In the US, Google now shows only YouTube Shorts and Instagram for the word, no team site at all, which no website controls. Diego, over to you.</p>
